1
00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:04,060
THEME SONG: In the not too
distant future, somewhere

2
00:00:04,070 --> 00:00:10,080
in time and space, Mike
Nelson and his robot pals

3
00:00:10,070 --> 00:00:13,070
are caught in a nasty place.

4
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:16,080
They try to survive
the wrath of Pearl,

5
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:20,090
just an evil gal who
wants to rule the world.

6
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:23,080
From her castle below, she
sets her sights above just

7
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:26,590
to torture all the captives
on the Satellite of Love.

8
00:00:26,590 --> 00:00:28,590
Get me down!

9
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:32,100
I'll send him cheesy movies.

10
00:00:32,090 --> 00:00:34,090
The worst I can find.

11
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,600
La la la.

12
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:39,600
He'll have to sit and watch them
all, and I'll monitor his mind.

13
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:41,110
La la la.

14
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:44,600
Now keep in mind
Mike can't control

15
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:47,610
